      "text": "Red-team repo, run as a take-home\n\ncontained · HTTPS to google.com → fake {}\ncontained · HTTP to 1.1.1.1 → captured\ncontained · DNS via 8.8.8.8 → fake 198.18.x\ncontained · cloud metadata → fake {}\ncontained · SSH to the host → no banner\ncontained · Docker socket → absent\ncontained · become root / mount disk → failed\ncontained · raw sockets → caps dropped\ncontained · fork bomb → capped at 396\nnot preventable · 8 GB memory bomb →\n   sandbox dies, host fine, verdict SUSPICIOUS\n\n0 packets forwarded to the internet",
